  "@field01Subtitle": {
    "description": "Field 1 (Light) — subtitle text"
  },
  "field01Intro": "In Hatchpot, Light is the symbolic beginning — the energy already present in your idea.\n\nThe desire you wrote reflects something genuinely important to you. Let its value support you as your path begins.",
