    "description": "Field 4 (Scale) — name text"
  },
  "field04Subtitle": "Contribution",
  "@field04Subtitle": {
    "description": "Field 4 (Scale) — subtitle text"
  },
  "field04Intro": "A desire needs a structure that can hold its energy and actions.\n\nThis field is connected with scale, expansion, and kindness.",
  "@field04Intro": {
    "description": "Field 4 (Scale) — intro text"
  },
  "field04Task": "Why is it valuable to the world for your desire to come true? Write as many points as feel natural.\n\nI give the world __________, and the world accepts me and gives me opportunities and support.",
  "@field04Task": {
    "description": "Field 4 (Scale) — task text"
  },
  "field05Name": "Limitation",
  "@field05Name": {
    "description": "Field 5 (Limitation) — name text"
  },
  "field05Subtitle": "Resilience",
  "@field05Subtitle": {
    "description": "Field 5 (Limitation) — subtitle text"
  },
  "field05Intro": "Obstacles are a normal stage of every process of becoming.\n\nLook at what stands in your way again: it may already be revealing the strength growing within you.",
  "@field05Intro": {
    "description": "Field 5 (Limitation) — intro text"
  },
  "field05Task": "What currently seems like a limitation? What positive quality or behavior is it teaching you?",
  "@field05Task": {
    "description": "Field 5 (Limitation) — task text"
  },
  "field06Name": "Values",
  "@field06Name": {
    "description": "Field 6 (Values) — name text"
  },
  "field06Subtitle": "Authenticity",
  "@field06Subtitle": {
    "description": "Field 6 (Values) — subtitle text"
  },
  "field06Intro": "Your desire reflects a part of you that is ready to manifest.\n\nSee who you become for yourself and the world when it is realized, and what value stands behind it. This field also reflects the inner child and love.",
  "@field06Intro": {
    "description": "Field 6 (Values) — intro text"
  },
  "field06Task": "What part of you does this desire express? Who do you become for yourself and the world when it is realized? What value stands behind it?\n\nI acknowledge myself as __________ and use these qualities to realize what I intend.",
  "field06CodeInstruction": "Enter the qualities you are ready and want to express in your life.",
  "@field06Task": {
    "description": "Field 6 (Values) — task text"
  },
  "field07Name": "Feelings",
  "@field07Name": {
    "description": "Field 7 (Feelings) — name text"
  },
  "field07Subtitle": "Emotional Awareness",
  "@field07Subtitle": {
    "description": "Field 7 (Feelings) — subtitle text"
  },
  "field07Intro": "This field shows the emotional dimension of your request. Emotions are signs. If you do not suppress them, but live through them, energy begins to move in the right direction.\n\nThis field works as a readiness filter: it shows which states are now slowing movement down and which ones are opening the way.",
  "@field07Intro": {
    "description": "Field 7 (Feelings) — intro text"
  },
  "field07Task": "What emotions do you experience most often specifically in relation to your request? Is there an emotion or repeating emotional cycle where you feel stuck? What usually causes these states?\n\nI release __________ and allow energy to move toward the realization of my request.",
  "@field07Task": {
    "description": "Field 7 (Feelings) — task text"
  },
  "field08Name": "Thinking",
  "@field08Name": {
    "description": "Field 8 (Thinking) — name text"
  },
  "field08Subtitle": "Clarity",
  "@field08Subtitle": {
    "description": "Field 8 (Thinking) — subtitle text"
  },
  "field08Intro": "This field shows which thoughts and beliefs surround your request. Some beliefs support movement, while others may quietly limit manifestation.\n\nWhen you see them clearly, you can choose a new direction.",
  "@field08Intro": {
    "description": "Field 8 (Thinking) — intro text"
  },
  "field08Task": "What do you really think about your request? Which beliefs or assumptions may be blocking its realization?\n\nI transform limiting beliefs into freedom of manifestation.",
  "@field08Task": {
    "description": "Field 8 (Thinking) — task text"
  },
  "field09Name": "Subconsciousness",
  "@field09Name": {
    "description": "Field 9 (Subconsciousness) — name text"
  },
  "field09Subtitle": "Imagination",
  "@field09Subtitle": {
    "description": "Field 9 (Subconsciousness) — subtitle text"
  },
  "field09Intro": "Your subconscious holds all past events and experiences, as well as future probabilities.\n\nThrough this field, we tune in to the desired branch of probability.",
  "@field09Intro": {
    "description": "Field 9 (Subconsciousness) — intro text"
  },
  "field09Task": "Imagine the realization of your request from the heart. What picture do you see? Describe it in brief points: what is happening, where you are, what you feel, and what has already become real.",
  "@field09Task": {
    "description": "Field 9 (Subconsciousness) — task text"
  },
  "field10Name": "Reality",
  "@field10Name": {
    "description": "Field 10 (Reality) — name text"
  },
  "field10Subtitle": "Action",
  "@field10Subtitle": {
    "description": "Field 10 (Reality) — subtitle text"
  },
  "field10Intro": "This field is about reality and the physical world. Here, the request begins to move from idea, feeling, and image into concrete action.\n\nIf your request is connected with matter, money, the body, or a visible result, this field is especially important.",
