    "description": "Field 18 (Movement) — intro text"
  },
  "field18Task": "What action are you willing to do with discipline to reach your desire?\n\nFor how long are you willing to keep doing it?\n\nI will do __________ regularly for __________ to move closer to my desire.",
  "@field18Task": {
    "description": "Field 18 (Movement) — task text"
  },
  "field19Name": "Truth",
  "@field19Name": {
    "description": "Field 19 (Truth) — name text"
  },
  "field19Subtitle": "Honesty",
  "@field19Subtitle": {
    "description": "Field 19 (Truth) — subtitle text"
  },
  "field19Intro": "Progress begins with seeing things as they are.\n\nTruth creates the foundation for change.",
  "@field19Intro": {
    "description": "Field 19 (Truth) — intro text"
  },
  "field19Task": "What is true for you right now?\n\nMy truth right now is __________.\n\nTo move closer to my desire, I intend to improve __________.",
  "@field19Task": {
    "description": "Field 19 (Truth) — task text"
  },
  "field20Name": "Purpose",
  "@field20Name": {
    "description": "Field 20 (Purpose) — name text"
  },
  "field20Subtitle": "Courage",
  "@field20Subtitle": {
    "description": "Field 20 (Purpose) — subtitle text"
  },
  "field20Intro": "A meaningful goal benefits more than just yourself.\n\nWhen your desire serves a greater purpose, it becomes stronger.\n\nIt takes courage to follow your own path.\n\nThe more meaningful your goal is, the more people it can inspire and help.",
  "@field20Intro": {
    "description": "Field 20 (Purpose) — intro text"
  },
  "field20Task": "How could your desire benefit others?\n\nWrite 10 ways your desire could help other people.",
  "@field20Task": {
    "description": "Field 20 (Purpose) — task text"
  },
  "field21Name": "Change",
  "@field21Name": {
    "description": "Field 21 (Change) — name text"
  },
  "field21Subtitle": "Flexibility",
  "@field21Subtitle": {
    "description": "Field 21 (Change) — subtitle text"
  },
  "field21Intro": "Life keeps moving.\n\nYou cannot control every change, but you can learn to move with it.",
  "@field21Intro": {
    "description": "Field 21 (Change) — intro text"
  },
  "field21Task": "What is beginning to unfold in your life right now?\n\nI let go of control over __________ and allow life to move.\n\nI notice that __________ is beginning to unfold in my life.\n\nI start doing __________ to grow __________.",
  "@field21Task": {
    "description": "Field 21 (Change) — task text"
  },
  "field22Name": "Balance",
  "@field22Name": {
    "description": "Field 22 (Balance) — name text"
  },
  "field22Subtitle": "Self-Mastery",
  "@field22Subtitle": {
    "description": "Field 22 (Balance) — subtitle text"
  },
  "field22Intro": "True strength is not force.\n\nIt is the ability to balance power and gentleness.",
  "@field22Intro": {
    "description": "Field 22 (Balance) — intro text"
  },
  "field22Task": "Where in your life could you stop forcing and start responding with balance?\n\nWhere could you use less force and more balance?\n\nMy strength is that I can __________ without forcing, controlling, or fighting.",
  "@field22Task": {
    "description": "Field 22 (Balance) — task text"
  },
  "field23Name": "Observe",
  "@field23Name": {
    "description": "Field 23 (Observe) — name text"
  },
  "field23Subtitle": "Awareness",
  "@field23Subtitle": {
    "description": "Field 23 (Observe) — subtitle text"
  },
  "field23Intro": "Sometimes a pause is also a step forward.\n\nBy observing, you begin to see things differently.",
  "@field23Intro": {
    "description": "Field 23 (Observe) — intro text"
  },
  "field23Task": "What are you trying to force right now?\n\nTake one minute to pause and observe.\n\nWhat do you see differently now?\n\nBy slowing down, I realize __________.",
  "@field23Task": {
    "description": "Field 23 (Observe) — task text"
  },
  "field24Name": "Transformation",
  "@field24Name": {
    "description": "Field 24 (Transformation) — name text"
  },
  "field24Subtitle": "Ability to Change",
  "@field24Subtitle": {
    "description": "Field 24 (Transformation) — subtitle text"
  },
  "field24Intro": "Growth requires change.\n\nTo create something new, you may need to let go of something old.",
  "@field24Intro": {
    "description": "Field 24 (Transformation) — intro text"
  },
  "field24Task": "What are you holding on to that no longer serves you?\n\nWhat needs to change in you to reach your goal?\n\nI let go of __________ to become myself.",
  "@field24Task": {
    "description": "Field 24 (Transformation) — task text"
  },
  "field25Name": "Intention",
  "@field25Name": {
    "description": "Field 25 (Intention) — name text"
  },
  "field25Subtitle": "Focus",
  "@field25Subtitle": {
    "description": "Field 25 (Intention) — subtitle text"
  },
  "field25Intro": "What you focus on grows.\n\nA clear intention gives your desire direction and meaning.",
  "@field25Intro": {
    "description": "Field 25 (Intention) — intro text"
  },
  "field25Task": "Why does this desire matter to you?\n\nThis desire matters to me because __________.",
  "@field25Task": {
    "description": "Field 25 (Intention) — task text"
  },
  "field26Name": "Attachment",
  "@field26Name": {
    "description": "Field 26 (Attachment) — name text"
  },
  "field26Subtitle": "Self-Honesty",
  "@field26Subtitle": {
    "description": "Field 26 (Attachment) — subtitle text"
  },
  "field26Intro": "Not everything you hold onto is truly yours.\n\nSometimes fear disguises itself as a desire.",
  "@field26Intro": {
    "description": "Field 26 (Attachment) — intro text"
  },
  "field26Task": "What are you doing because you are afraid not to?\n\nOne goal that no longer feels truly mine is __________.\n\nOne intention that still feels true is __________.",
  "@field26Task": {
    "description": "Field 26 (Attachment) — task text"
  },
  "field27Name": "Breakdown",
  "@field27Name": {
    "description": "Field 27 (Breakdown) — name text"
  },
  "field27Subtitle": "Resilience",
  "@field27Subtitle": {
    "description": "Field 27 (Breakdown) — subtitle text"
  },
  "field27Intro": "Sometimes something old needs to break down before you can move forward.\n\nWhen your thoughts and feelings work together, your path becomes clearer.",
  "@field27Intro": {
    "description": "Field 27 (Breakdown) — intro text"
  },
  "field27Task": "What do you think about your desire?\n\nWhat do you feel about your desire?\n\nIs there a contradiction between the two?\n\nIf there is a contradiction, try to bring your thoughts and feelings together.\n\nWhat do your feelings need to hear?\n\nWhat do your thoughts need to understand?",
  "@field27Task": {
    "description": "Field 27 (Breakdown) — task text"
  },
  "field28Name": "Guidance",
  "@field28Name": {
    "description": "Field 28 (Guidance) — name text"
  },
  "field28Subtitle": "Alignment with Flow",
  "@field28Subtitle": {
    "description": "Field 28 (Guidance) — subtitle text"
  },
  "field28Intro": "Life flows through receiving and giving.\n\nThe more open you are to this flow, the easier it becomes to follow your path.",
  "@field28Intro": {
    "description": "Field 28 (Guidance) — intro text"
  },
  "field28Task": "Where is this desire guiding you?\n\nMy desire is guiding me toward __________.\n\nI choose to be myself and trust the flow, even if __________.",
  "@field28Task": {
    "description": "Field 28 (Guidance) — task text"
  },
  "field29Name": "Feeling",
  "@field29Name": {
    "description": "Field 29 (Feeling) — name text"
  },
  "field29Subtitle": "Sensitivity",
  "@field29Subtitle": {
    "description": "Field 29 (Feeling) — subtitle text"
  },
  "field29Intro": "Not everything can be seen clearly.\n\nSometimes the only way forward is to trust what you feel.",
  "@field29Intro": {
    "description": "Field 29 (Feeling) — intro text"
  },
  "field29Task": "What are you afraid to face?\n\nI am ready to face __________.\n\nI meet the shadow that __________.",
  "@field29Task": {
    "description": "Field 29 (Feeling) — task text"
  },
  "field30Name": "Integration",
  "@field30Name": {
    "description": "Field 30 (Integration) — name text"
  },
  "field30Subtitle": "Recognition",
  "@field30Subtitle": {
    "description": "Field 30 (Integration) — subtitle text"
  },
  "field30Intro": "You begin to recognize yourself in a new reality.\n\nThe more clearly you see who you are becoming, the easier it becomes to integrate this identity into your life.",
  "@field30Intro": {
    "description": "Field 30 (Integration) — intro text"
  },
  "field30Task": "Who are you when this desire is already part of your life?\n\nWho are you when this desire has already come true?\n\nI am a person who __________.\n\nI recognize myself as someone who __________.",
  "@field30Task": {
    "description": "Field 30 (Integration) — task text"
  },
  "field31Name": "Awakening",
  "@field31Name": {
    "description": "Field 31 (Awakening) — name text"
  },
  "field31Subtitle": "Action",
  "@field31Subtitle": {
    "description": "Field 31 (Awakening) — subtitle text"
  },
  "field31Intro": "You already know enough.\n\nThe question is no longer what you want. The question is whether you are ready to act.",
  "@field31Intro": {
    "description": "Field 31 (Awakening) — intro text"
  },
  "field31Task": "What action can you no longer postpone?\n\nWhat action do you know you need to take?\n\nI am ready to take action and __________.\n\nI wake up and take action by __________.",
  "@field31Task": {
    "description": "Field 31 (Awakening) — task text"
  },
  "field32Name": "Wholeness",
  "@field32Name": {
    "description": "Field 32 (Wholeness) — name text"
  },
  "field32Subtitle": "Bravery",
  "@field32Subtitle": {
    "description": "Field 32 (Wholeness) — subtitle text"
  },
  "field32Intro": "Wholeness begins when you gather all parts of yourself.\n\nYou may still feel fear, but you are ready to take the next step.",
  "@field32Intro": {
    "description": "Field 32 (Wholeness) — intro text"
  },
  "field32Task": "What fears still stand between you and your next step?\n\nI acknowledge these fears, and I choose to move toward __________ anyway.",
  "@field32Task": {
    "description": "Field 32 (Wholeness) — task text"
  },
